# No profile / auth UI

Moventiq MVP is **device-local only**. Never add:

- Profile page, avatar, display name, email, PRO badge
- Sign-in, sign-up, OAuth, or any authentication flow
- Cloud sync, account settings, or third-party integrations (Calendar, Maps, etc.)
- "Delete account" — use **Clear all data** in Settings → Privacy instead

The Settings tab is **app preferences**, not a user profile. All data lives in Room on device.
